# The synthetic E1M1: run north into the west room's north wall, keep
# pushing, then strafe right along it (sliding), up the 16-unit step into
# the east room and into its north-east corner; then back off diagonally.
iwad synthetic
# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
50 0 0 0 x20
50 40 0 0 x40
-50 -40 0 0 x12
0 0 0 0 x10
